# Rule: Landing v7

When editing these paths, you are in a **layered composite** (fixed `.gateway`, sticky hero, opaque stations) — not a flat page.

**Read first:** `sentinel/decisions/008-landing-v7-background-layers.md`, `sentinel/decisions/010-brandmark-choreography.md`, `sentinel/decisions/031-rail-manifest.md`, `sentinel/decisions/033-arc-cases-orbit.md` (orbit superseded; funnel live), `sentinel/decisions/034-arc-cases-terrace.md` (superseded by ADR-035), `sentinel/decisions/035-arc-cases-terminal.md` (the live cases reveal), `.claude/skills/landing-v7-compositing/SKILL.md`, `.claude/skills/brandmark-choreography/SKILL.md`.

**Funnel (ADR-033):** hero → corridor (thesis + Arc) → services → about →
continuum → practice → contact. `#tools`/`#build` retired — the four
production cases live ONLY on the Arc's Build-park cases reveal
(click-armed "VIEW THE CASES" chip under the Build title; a fixed DOM
overlay unfurls edges-to-centre, no camera move — ADR-035). Order is owned by the parse arrays in `app/(marketing)/page.tsx`,
in lockstep with `lib/rail-manifest/entries.ts` + the drift-guard tests;
never reorder via prototype-HTML edits. `PROJECT_CASES` is the single
canonical case module; the rest of `tools-cards/` is the
`/test/project-cards` lab's shared core — do not remount it on the
landing.

**Arc Cases is a fixed DOM overlay — no camera channel (ADR-035, supersedes
ADR-034):** the cases reveal is `ArcCasesTerminal`, a fixed DOM overlay
(chip `ArcCasesTerminalCta` docked under the Build title). On arm the two
halves converge to a centre seam via a CSS clip-path transition and the
sources/surfaces DOM labels fade on `arcCasesLevelRef` (single writer = the
overlay's DOM rAF; readers = `gateStackLabel` + the caption fade + — since
ADR-035 Update 1 — `ShellStack`, which folds the source/surface node streams
onto the panel's exact left/right borders so the screen reads as mounted on the
nodes. The ref now also carries the panel's screen `panelRect` as the single
source of truth for that mount geometry; the fold re-solves its attach points
against the live camera each frame and is a per-frame morph of the existing
stream geometry, flag-off / unarmed = rest pose byte-identical). The
corridor camera is a pure Z dolly again — the ADR-034 lateral shift,
`getTerraceViewportLayout`, and the terrain-shroud screen are RETIRED. Gate
parity (`ARC_CASES_MEDIA` == the CSS hide of dock + overlay); no scroll
writer/lock/backdrop; inert reconciled every frame; DOM order = focus order.
Do not restore a camera channel or an in-canvas cases object.

**Rail manifest (ADR-031; roster ADR-033):** the left-rail manifest
skeleton is parse-injected (`lib/v7-parse/railManifest.ts`) and mutated
in place by `RailManifestController` — never `createRoot` into
`[data-rail-manifest-root]`, keep the prototype shell byte-exact, and
change journey order only in `lib/rail-manifest/entries.ts` (drift-guard
tested). The rolodex renders ONLY the pillars **Arc / Services / About**.
The reel detent (Update 3) is a 350ms transform transition gated behind
`data-ready`, a pure function of `activeIdx` — never scroll-scrubbed;
glyph confirm stays quantized `steps()`; no FLIP flights; the 13-tick
ladder always stays. The right rail: `THE ARC · 03` register during the
corridor, `SOURCE BUS · 04` (`ServicesRailRegister`, services.css) during
services — both on the shared `--rail-register-pitch` grid, active row =
gold underline.

**Process:** `sentinel/MAINTENANCE.md` — Cycle B before large section work; Cycle A after non-trivial fixes.
